WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Hello, this is a quick demo of my Personal Finance Management app.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
I'll start by adding an income of 30,000.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Next, I'll add an expense of 500 for transportation.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.000
I can see the financial summary.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
I can delete a transaction when I enter 5, and search by category when I enter 6.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
7 saves the data, and finally, I will exit.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Thank you for watching!